{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Intervals 是一款主打即時預覽的底片風格相機，觀景畫面直接呈現最終成像，適合喜歡復古色調、不想拍完才後悔的攝影愛好者。內置 25 款原創風格，並可設定間隔拍攝。原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-229.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>即時預覽二十五款底片風格</h2>\n<p>有別於先拍後套的濾鏡，Intervals 將風格即時套用於觀景畫面，全畫質呈現，滑動畫面即可用手指比對效果。25 款原創風格取材自真實底片反應，日光、夜拍、黑白與實驗色調俱備。間隔拍攝可設定張數、間距與延遲，由一秒至一小時、最多 999 張；事後亦可重新選擇風格或調整強度，原圖保留在相簿。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-227-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-228-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-229-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-230-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-231-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-232-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Intervals: Film Look Camera</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/intervals-film-look-camera/id6814415229?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T21:18:36.901992+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":328,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T20:57:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T21:32:08.042195+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T21:11:51.742586+00:00","content_hash":"82ff392ed7b9390dfec097558863830ece6a7517bcd87f9b12a297ae85a8a41a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}